SUMMARY:The Incredible Trailmen Showcase Open House
DESCRIPTION:The Incredible Trailmen Showcase Open House\n\nActivities:\n- Water Rescue Challenge: A team sled-pull relay to demonstrate rescue techniques.\n- Fire Starting: A skill-building station for ignition\, utilizing turkey basting pans and flint/steel.\n- First Aid Station: Demonstrations on tourniquets\, bandaging\, and the creation of improvised stretchers.\n- Showcase Craft: Construction of leather keychains with paracord.\n- Refreshments: Water balloons and s'mores.\n\nNon-member guests allowed. Uniform required. Medical form not required.
LOCATION:St. Michael the Archangel Catholic Church\, 490 Arnold Mill Rd.\, Woodstock\, GA 30188
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
